{"id": "1791492", "name": "זיהוי תתי-סדרות של סדרה נתונה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "an", "params": ["n"], "body": "1/(aa*n + bb)"}, {"name": "bn", "params": ["n"], "body": "1/(cc*aa*n + bb)"}, {"name": "cn", "params": ["n"], "body": "1/(n + dd)"}, {"name": "dn", "params": ["n"], "body": "1/(aa*(2^n) + bb + aa)"}, {"name": "en", "params": ["n"], "body": "1/(aa*n+dd)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא הסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle a_n={{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>לכל אחת מן הסדרות הבאות קבעו אם היא <b>תת־סדרה</b> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left(a_n\\right)\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle b_n={{CT:1}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle c_n={{CT:2}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle d_n={{CT:3}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle e_n={{CT:4}} \\)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">זיהוי תתי־סדרות</b><br><p>סדרה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left(u_n\\right)\\)</span> היא תת־סדרה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left(a_n\\right)\\)</span> אם אפשר לכתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle u_n=a_{k_n}\\)</span> עבור סדרת אינדקסים טבעיים עולה ממש.</p><p>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n=\\dfrac{1}{{{CT:5}}n+{{CT:6}}}\\)</span>.</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{{{CT:7}}n+{{CT:6}}}=a_{{{CT:8}}n}\\)</span>, ולכן זו תת־סדרה.</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{n+{{CT:9}}}\\)</span> אינה מתקבלת מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle n\\)</span> באמצעות אינדקסים טבעיים מתאימים.</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{{{CT:5}}\\cdot 2^n+{{CT:6}}+{{CT:5}}}=a_{2^n+1}\\)</span>, ולכן זו תת־סדרה.</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{{{CT:5}}n+{{CT:9}}}\\)</span> אינה תת־סדרה, משום שהיה נדרש להזיז את האינדקס ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:9}}-{{CT:6}}}{{{CT:5}}}\\)</span>, שאינו מספר שלם.</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "subseq[1][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.25, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>טעית בנוגע לסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ b_n \\]</p></div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "subseq[2][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>טעית בנוגע לסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ c_n \\]</p></div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "subseq[3][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>טעית בנוגע לסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ d_n \\]</p></div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "subseq[4][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>טעית בנוגע לסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ e_n \\]</p></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["LL", "a", "aa", "bb", "cc", "dd", "subseq", "w"], "nvariants": 50}